BEHAVIOR pad-right

DESCRIPTION
  Copies the null-terminated s into result, then appends the byte `value` until
  result is `target` bytes long (no-op if s is already >= target). result is
  null-terminated; length is the byte count (excluding the terminator).

CONTRACT
  INPUT s bytes 65536
  INPUT target int 8
  INPUT value int 8
  OUTPUT result bytes 65536
  OUTPUT length int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 69153687

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE result 0 1 0
  tv = LOAD target 8
  bv = LOAD value 8
  i = 0

  LABEL cp
    c = LOAD s 1 i
    z = IEQ c 0 1
    BRANCH z cpdone cpb
  LABEL cpb
    STORE result c 1 i
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP cp

  LABEL cpdone
  LABEL pad
    pdone = IGE i tv 8
    BRANCH pdone fin padb
  LABEL padb
    STORE result bv 1 i
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP pad

  LABEL fin
    STORE result 0 1 i
    STORE length i 8
END
